@RoomToRentRadar.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### US02 T02.1 — available room (phone masked when anonymous)
GET {{RoomToRentRadar.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/listings/room-2026-001
Accept: application/json

### US02 T02.1 — unavailable room + similarRooms
GET {{RoomToRentRadar.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/listings/room-2026-004
Accept: application/json

### Not found
GET {{RoomToRentRadar.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/listings/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json
